www.neopoligen.com overrides

This directory gets synced to:

~/Document/Neopoligen/neopoligen.github.io/...

after the main `thems/neopoligen-v0.1.0` theme. 

The reason for that is that right now, everything
is coming off the neopoligen-v0.1.0 theme to start
with as we build it out and the sync process
will delete anything it points to for the
time being. 


